        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 60251, Ornate Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 60251 Lockset features an elaborate design that will fit in amongst even the most grandiose homes. Everything from the ornate swirling designs on the ends to the equally ornamented lever exudes sophistication. A narrow backset mortise handleset, it is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2\" or 2\". It is available in either brass or shaded bronze in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/ornate-egret-door-lever-omnia-251-00\"><b>Ornate Egret Door Lever</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 11-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Narrow Backset Handleset, Omnia 60251",
                "description": "Omnia 60251 Ornate Narrow Backset Handleset - Omnia's 60251 Lockset features an elaborate design that will fit in amongst even the most grandiose homes. Everything from the ornate swirling designs on the ends to the equally ornamented lever exudes sophistication. A narrow backset mortise handleset, it is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches. It is available in either brass or shaded bronze in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.",
